@open_issue_touch_sensitivity user reports "아예 인식안됨" (touch not recognized at all) in iter3 + "감지 한번떳다가 유지가 안됨 이후에는 무조건 no touch" (detect once then always no-touch). iter4 lowers threshold + adds debug panel showing per-tick top-3 channel deviations regardless of detection trigger — user can SEE which channel changes when finger touches even if threshold doesn't fire. Tuning continues per user feedback.

